Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5079090,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-5079090","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:23Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5079090,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-5079090","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:23Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5079090,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5079090-1847286114043720","game_id":"steam-5079090","kind":"update","title":"Update: a fairer pace, and Sarge explains himself","summary":"A small update for the demo and the full game. Changes [*] A fairer pace. In campaign battles the enemy now builds up more slowly, so you have more time to get a proper mob together before things turn nasty. The change is biggest on Recruit (half the old pace) and Regular, smaller on Veteran, and Hardened is almost unchanged. Endless mode is untouched. [*] Boot Camp: waiting has a cost. The drill sergeant now warns that the enemy gets stronger the longer you sit in the trench: more of them, toug","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T05:04:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043720","verified_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079090-1847286114027298","game_id":"steam-5079090","kind":"update","title":"Update: a steadier camera, cheaper Medics and Runners","summary":"A small update for the demo and the full game, straight from Next Fest feedback. Changes The camera stays put when your men go over the top. You can keep shoring up the line instead of being dragged across no man's land. Prefer the old follow-cam? Switch on OTT auto-scroll in Settings. Boot Camp mentions it. The drill sergeant now tells you where that switch lives. Bring a hanky. Cheaper Medics and Runners. Both now cost 50 glory in the Depot, so your first unlock comes sooner. Existing saves ha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T02:16:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027298","verified_at":"2026-10-21T09:41:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079090-1846651706691407","game_id":"steam-5079090","kind":"announcement","title":"Dirt & Viscera is in Steam Next Fest","summary":"Steam Next Fest starts today, and the free Sector One demo of Dirt & Viscera: The Great War is part of it until 26 October. If you haven't played it yet: you hold a section of the Western Front with whatever the cards deal you, from riflemen and machine guns to flamethrowers, gas and the odd Mark IV. Then you decide when to stop holding and go over the top. Go too early and the wire takes them. Go too late and the trench is overrun. The demo is the whole of Sector One: a branching map of battles","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691407","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079090-1846651706685296","game_id":"steam-5079090","kind":"update","title":"Update: machine guns and artillery from day one","summary":"A new demo build is live, just in time for Next Fest. Everything below is in the full game too. New Machine guns and artillery from the start. Every company now begins with both, so your very first battles have real choices in them instead of an hour of riflemen. Boot Camp covers more. The drill sergeant now explains call-ins, the request buttons, the hold-back slider, sending the next wave and pausing. He has also become slightly ruder. A trick worth knowing: men at the back of the trench are t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T18:25:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685296","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079090-1846651706672805","game_id":"steam-5079090","kind":"update","title":"Update: aim your Strafing Run, plus two new Depot upgrades","summary":"A new demo build is live. Everything below is in the full game too. New Aim your Strafing Run. Click and drag to set the line the plane flies. A plain click still sends it straight up the field, and you now see the lane before you commit. Armour Leads (Depot, 150 glory). Adds a Send Armour order: your tanks roll out on their own, and the infantry stay in the trench until you send them over behind the armour. Fire Discipline (Depot, 120 glory, needs Mortar Team). Your mortar crews won't drop a ro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T00:49:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672805","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079090-1846018067937282","game_id":"steam-5079090","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: menu fixes, tooltips and two new buttons","summary":"A small update to the Sector One demo is now live.FixesThe main menu now fits on smaller screens, and on PCs with Windows display scaling turned up. Before, the title and some buttons could be cut off.- Tooltips now appear in the game's own style instead of the plain Windows box.NewTwo buttons sit next to your cards in battle. Request reinforcements: each click shaves a little off the wait for your next cards. Request requisition: each click scrapes together a little more requisition. Click away","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T20:49:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937282","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079090-1845383656389486","game_id":"steam-5079090","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is out now","summary":"The Sector One demo is out now.It's the full opening sector of the campaign: a branching map of battles along the line, ending in a Great Push. You hold a section of the Western Front with whatever the cards deal you, and decide when to stop holding and go over the top.The demo will still be here for Steam Next Fest, 19-26 October, and the full game follows on 4 November.Found a bug, or something you'd change? There's a \"Report a Bug / Suggestion\" button on the main menu. It comes straight to me","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T16:09:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389486","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079090-1844751498233090","game_id":"steam-5079090","kind":"announcement","title":"Release date: 4 November 2026","summary":"Dirt & Viscera: The Great War launches on Steam on 4 November 2026.Before that, a free demo is planned for Steam Next Fest, 19-26 October.Hold a section of the Western Front with whatever the Quartermaster sends you, and choose the moment to go over the top.Wishlist to be notified when the demo and the game go live.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T04:03:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498233090","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5079090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:43Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:42Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5079090":"2026-10-26T08:00:43Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5079090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:42Z"},"5082330":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:43Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5079090","app_id":5079090,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:24Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"d005e49d4fcf10feef62d9d5e0f69091053d646cd842487676375cda11c502e4","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Hold a W